{"id":"hein","lemma":"hein","pos":"intj","rank":197,"glosses":["huh, hey, eh"],"ipa":"/ɛ̃/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/e/e6/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-LoquaxFR-hein.wav/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-LoquaxFR-hein.wav.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Tu es curieux, hein ?","en":"You are curious, aren't you?","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"are","l":"être"},{"g":"curious"},null]},{"text":"Tu aimes ça, hein ?","en":"You like it, huh?","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"to love","l":"aimer"},{"g":"that"},null]},{"text":"Tu as pensé à tout, hein ?","en":"You've thought of everything, haven't you?","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"to think","l":"penser"},{"g":"to / at"},{"g":"all"},null]},{"text":"Vous posez beaucoup de questions, hein.","en":"You ask a lot of questions, don't you?","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"to stop carrying","l":"poser"},{"g":"much, very much, a lot"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"question","l":"question"},null]},{"text":"C'est une blague, hein ?","en":"This is a joke, right?","words":[{"g":"it / that"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"joke"},null]}]}